category: Utils
build-depends: cygport libbrotli-devel libbz2-devel libcrypt-devel libdb-devel liblmdb-devel libmemcached-devel libpcre2-devel libssl-devel libzstd-devel openldap-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Implementation of an ICAP server (utilities)"
ldesc: "c-icap is an implementation of an ICAP server. It can be used with HTTP
proxies that support the ICAP protocol to implement content adaptation
and filtering services."
